=================
 dbt7-get-config
=================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-get-config** [option...]

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-get-config** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) configuration capture
script.  It saves the test configuration and system information to a
*config.txt* file in the output directory.  It is normally invoked by
**dbt7-run**\ (1).

OPTIONS
=======

-a DBMS  *dbms* under test (pgsql).
-d DIALECT  *dialect* override.
-i INPUT  *input* override.
-n STREAMS  Number of throughput *streams*.
-o PATH  Output directory.
-p PARAMETERS  Database *parameters* for the load test (PostgreSQL only).
-q PARAMETERS  Database *parameters* for the power test (PostgreSQL only).
-s SCALE  *scale* factor, default 1.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1)
